.TH lxde-logout 1 "Mar 21, 2008" "lxde-logout"

.SH "نام (NAME)"
lxde-logout \-program for...

.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.B lxde-logout
.br

.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
This manual page explains the
.B lxde-logout
program. This program is part of LXDE.
.PP
\fBlxde-logout\fP, as its name implies, is for logging out LXDE.
Running this program will show the logout dialog on the screen.

.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
startlxde

.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
Hong Jen Yee <pcman.tw@gmail.com>